      "statusChangeNewStatus": "interested",
      "value": "Good feedback. The status colors carried most of the signal in the old list, and big solid banners do compete with them for attention. \n\nWe don't have a change scheduled for this yet so I don't want to promise a fix, but it's noted, and it lines up with other reports about colors fighting each other in list views.",
