      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name} The overall visibility has undeniably gotten worse.\n\nThe Social menu was already cumbersome to use, since you had to open each friend's profile individually just to check whether they were in a Private instance. Now, with avatar previews removed and colors becoming much more visually cluttered, it feels even less usable.\n\nI don't mind what specific solution is chosen, but I hope future UI changes focus on improving usability rather than changing things for the sake of change.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
